Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:51.12,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tehlikesinin farkında ol.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.82,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kim bizden biri olacak?{\i0}
