Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:04.65,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Boş kalbini hayallerle doldur.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:06.99,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanatlarını aç.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:11.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kalbini esen rüzgarla boyarsan,...{\i0}
